# Crying Over Onions (windurst 76): the reply kinds at Port Windurst (Kohlo-Lakolo and the brigade have no script, so
# only another quest's line shows a kind). Level 5, fame 325, Onion Rings completed; Truth, Justice, and the Onion Way!
# accepted by GM (an Event line on every brigade member: Kohlo-Lakolo 371, Gomada-Vulmada 373, Papo-Hopo 372, Pichichi
# 374, Pyo Nzon 375, Shanruru 377, Yafa Yaa 376). An Event line of this quest ties with that line (the tie rotates by
# the last event id: one talk plays each); a Progress line plays on its talk; a replaceDefault line loses on both talks.
# - Section 1: the mustZone by GM, Reward 0: 440 (Event) ties with 371; a warp out and back: 449 (Progress); Reward 1,
#   the mustZone: 450 (Event) ties; a warp out and back: 496 (Progress), begun.
# - Section 2: Prog 0: 498 (Event) ties; Prog 3 by GM: 497 (Progress), Prog 4; 512 (Event) ties; the brigade's Prog 4
#   lines (Events) tie, each talked twice.
# - Section 3 (completed by GM, The Promise available): the six new defaults lose to the first quest's lines.
lists PortWindurst/Kohlo-Lakolo/onTrigger PortWindurst/Gomada-Vulmada/onTrigger PortWindurst/Papo-Hopo/onTrigger PortWindurst/Pichichi/onTrigger PortWindurst/Pyo_Nzon/onTrigger PortWindurst/Shanruru/onTrigger PortWindurst/Yafa_Yaa/onTrigger
